  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Capacity to Combat TIP in Laos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, IOM will assist Laos by strengthening the Laotian governments capacity to meet its legal commitments to combat human trafficking. IOM will work with the Government of Laos to develop a follow-on National Action Plan to take effect when the current National Action Plan ends in 2020. IOM also will work with the Ministry of Public Security to improve case referral between village mediation units, border officials, and police. IOM will engage with nonprofit organizations to build a network in northern Laos to assist and refer victims of trafficking to services and to increase prevention efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
